    "sentence_translations": [
      "Teacher's Day",
      "",
      "Does your country celebrate Teacher's Day?",
      "",
      "In China, Teacher's Day occurs every year on September 10th.",
      "On Teacher's Day, students will give their teacher flowers to express their feelings of gratitude.",
      "And if they have time, students who have already graduated will also return to the school to see their teacher.",
      "",
      "So why is Teacher's Day on September 10th?",
      "Because in China, the school start for new students is in September.",
      "In other words, Teacher's Day is immediately after school start.",
      "Everyone celebrates Teacher's Day together, and through this good atmosphere the children learn to respect their teacher.",
      "The teachers also better understand their responsibilities, and will work harder on educating the children.",
      ""
